            "text": "Kiss Me Goodbye (film)\nKiss Me Goodbye is a 1982 American romantic comedy film directed by Robert Mulligan and starring Sally Field, James Caan and Jeff Bridges. It is a remake of \"Dona Flor and Her Two Husbands\" (\"Dona Flor e Seus Dois Maridos\" in Portuguese), a 1976 Brazilian film starring Sonia Braga based on the book of the same name by Jorge Amado.",
